{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000c473","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0d2c4-4f2b-7620-b603-17ce30f31e40"},"sequence":148,"recorded_at":1780531400000291,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"312c8d31-8278-4b5e-92ac-bdc5e8392e23","payload_type":"tool.result","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"tool_result","command_id":"312c8d31-8278-4b5e-92ac-bdc5e8392e23","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"312c8d31-8278-4b5e-92ac-bdc5e8392e23"},"call_id":"call_01a0d2c4a722701da4c146adf5637028","text":"{\n  \"chunk_id\": \"exec-5-1\",\n  \"command\": \"task-board q 'get(TASK-260924-3n78rv) { checklist notes status outcomeResources }' 2>&1 | head -n 400\",\n  \"description\": \"Query task via get operation\",\n  \"exit_code\": 0,\n  \"terminal_status\": \"completed\",\n  \"output\": \"{\\\"checklist\\\":[{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Planning decisions by whole-domain oracle through the production planning entry: strategy (5 incl. archive_only and continuation_context) x profile (5) x item class (every Canonical Event kind and content-block type) yields exactly the expected disposition and reason set per pinned SPEC v0.7.0 §13.14.1/§13.14.2 (10385-10393, 10548-10570); continuation_context is explicitly non-native; historical tools are inert and incomplete calls become aborted history; source usage never becomes target accounting\\\",\\\"done\\\":true},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Authority is never escalated: VisibleMigrationProjection has exactly authority=user_context (10808-10812) and visible text comes only from typed escaped fields; foreign instructions stay low-authority history; for every injected instruction-like, reply-like, control-token-like and authorization-like text at every event position and every entry, the plan never emits an assistant reply, system instruction, tool call or authorization; an independent oracle classifies authority\\\",\\\"done\\\":true},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Axis inventory (strategy, profile, event kind, content-block type, text payload class, position) with generated ranges for unbounded text payloads plus a structural argument that authority is decided by type, never by text content; importer outcome grid keyed (package, entry, input) with moved classes named; reuse internal/clonefidelity and internal/cloneplan (landed checkpoints); task_delta, no registry edit\\\",\\\"done\\\":true},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Code written per task description and AC\\\",\\\"done\\\":true},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Relevant tests written for new or changed behavior and passing\\\",\\\"done\\\":true},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"In a managed Story worktree the candidate is left UNCOMMITTED in the worktree for the handoff to snapshot — never commit on the Story branch. A producer commit moves the branch tip off the recorded checkpoint and the handoff refuses with change_request_candidate_committed_past_checkpoint; repair with `git reset --soft \\\\u003ccheckpoint_oid\\\\u003e` before completing again.\\\",\\\"done\\\":true},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Every command, message, state, or refusal named in the AC is driven through the production entry point by a named committed test, or is declared a stated bound. Report coverage as a ratio — `n of m AC rows driven` — and name the production call site for each. Prose in place of the ratio is not evidence.\\\",\\\"done\\\":true},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Gating, refusing, validating, authorizing, or attesting behavior covered by negative tests that fail when the gate admits what it must reject, with the production call site named\\\",\\\"done\\\":true},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Every gate ships at least one NARROWING mutant — the gate stays present and is weakened to admit exactly one member of the class it must reject, and a named test must fail. A delete-only mutant proves only that the gate exists and is not accepted as evidence.\\\",\\\"done\\\":true},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"A gate that inspects source text is additionally attacked by a mutant that PRESERVES the searched-for token and changes behavior, and the mutant harness executes the behavioral suite, not only the static checker.\\\",\\\"done\\\":true},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Lint clean\\\",\\\"done\\\":true},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Relevant build/validation commands run after changes and build not broken\\\",\\\"done\\\":true},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"New outcome artifact attached on the board with a task-scoped name when the work produces notes, logs, screenshots, or other deliverables\\\",\\\"done\\\":true},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Important findings, decisions, anomalies, or regressions recorded in logbook when relevant\\\",\\\"done\\\":true},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Implementation matches AC\\\",\\\"done\\\":false},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Solution fits project architecture\\\",\\\"done\\\":true},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Tests green\\\",\\\"done\\\":true},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Gate, refusal, validation, authorization, and attestation behavior attacked, not read — positive-path-only evidence is not accepted\\\",\\\"done\\\":true},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"If review does not accept the work — verdict evidence added and status routed by the explicit verdict branches\\\",\\\"done\\\":true}],\\\"notes\\\":\\\"spawn workload selection: class=implementation source=explicit policy=spawn.workload_classes pair=muse/muse-spark/max pair_source=explicit match=recommended_rank_1 snapshot=sha256:12703c4ea40d4bba69ef5e32089d666fbbcc482e0bd7b83006fefd0daca183ea rationale=\\\\\\\"Chain 3 next leaf: projection planning + authority-by-type rules (split from 1jmmqn), after 1jmmqn checkpoint 5bfbc78; muse max.\\\\\\\"\\\\nspawn agent resolution: Agent selection: muse via explicit_override (preferred_agentic_system: mixed[muse,codex,claude], config: spawn.preferred_agentic_system)\\\\nspawn queued: [implementer] developer (muse) (run=RUN-260924-aa8f5f, max_parallel=20)\\\\nspawn run started: [implementer] developer (muse) (run=RUN-260924-aa8f5f)\\\\nrefresh-candidate attempted 3x, INTERNAL_ERROR change_request_checkpoint_conflict persisting recovery intent; only retained replay in base-refresh belongs to another story branch (dab37c0). Proceeding with implementation; will retry refresh before handoff per brief.\\\\nProducer evidence attached: results 18/18, conformance matrix, evidence tar 25KB. Full suite green 47/47 at -p 2; parallel reds proven load flakes (sessquery probe green both sides, sessstate fails identically on base, zero dep edge). refresh-candidate still refuses: stale recovery intent pins mid-work tree 8c0fc7d, current 2530f4d; --replay-resolutions with the conflict-free template also refused. Attempting handoff; if CR construction enforces trunk descent the stale intent needs operator clearing.\\\\nspawn run child final message (run=RUN-260924-aa8f5f, tools=203 patches=50 failed=4):\\\\nTASK-260924-3n78rv (implement projection planning and authority rules) is ready for review — board status `to-review`, all 14 checklist items checked, three outcome resources attached.\\\\n\\\\nWhat was built: new package `internal/cloneplanning` ([doc.go](/Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/agent-session-manager/.temp/STORY-260830-21bxa3/worktree/internal/cloneplanning/doc.go)) with 8 production entries — strategy/profile selection, event→item classification, per-item disposition planning, session planning with predicted counts, visible-text projection with `authority=user_context`, and a zero target-effects fold. Candidate is 16 new paths, uncommitted; no landed file edited, no registry edit. Derivation R-ARCH…R-SEL-P with pinned spec quotes, axis inventory, and bounds are in [TRACEABILITY.md](/Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/agent-session-manager/.temp/STORY-260830-21bxa3/worktree/internal/cloneplanning/TRACEABILITY.md).\\\\n\\\\nEvidence: AC coverage 18 of 18 rows driven with named call sites; 975-cell planning oracle, 6986-cell adversarial authority sweep, AST authority-shape guard with 4 control plants; 48 narrowings killed × 2 runs + neutral control survived, one raw log per plant per run; package 97.8% statements, vet/windows-vet/gofmt/race green; full suite green 47/47 at `-p 2`. Parallel full runs flaked on different heavy packages each time (proven load flakes: isolated probes green, sessstate fails identically on base, zero dep edge). Importer grid keyed (package, entry, input): 232 owner files byte-identical, moved classes none.\\\\n\\\\nTwo notes for the reviewer/orchestrator: `refresh-candidate` refuses on a stale recovery intent (pins mid-work tree, current tree moved on; conflict-free template also refused) — handoff still constructed the CR, but trunk descent may need operator attention. The `run_wrote_outside_worktree` warn at handoff lists only foreign/other-run paths from concurrent agents on this host, none from this run.\\\\nagent completed: [implementer] developer (muse) (exit=0)\\\\nspawn run completed: muse (run=RUN-260924-aa8f5f, pid=71002, exit=0)\\\\nspawn workload selection: class=review source=explicit policy=spawn.workload_classes pair=codex/gpt-6-sol/medium pair_source=explicit match=recommended_rank_1 snapshot=sha256:b05313c300e0e464f5d3d44647de95092c2fe703527cecdbb31c36693f1cc779 rationale=\\\\\\\"Independent review of the first-leaf CR1 of TASK-260924-3n78rv; operator routing: independent reviews on gpt-6-sol medium; producers on codex gpt-6-luna max (PR #58)\\\\\\\"\\\\nspawn agent resolution: Agent selection: codex via explicit_override (preferred_agentic_system: mixed[muse,codex,claude], config: spawn.preferred_agentic_system)\\\\nspawn queued: [reviewer] reviewer (codex) (run=RUN-260924-dda856, max_parallel=20)\\\\nspawn run started: [reviewer] reviewer (codex) (run=RUN-260924-dda856)\\\\nagent completed: [reviewer] reviewer (codex) (exit=0)\\\\nspawn run completed: codex (run=RUN-260924-dda856, pid=32482, exit=0)\\\\nloop-detector rev1: S2/S3/S5 not evaluable — runtime-recorded verdict carries no stamped findings array\\\\nspawn workload selection: class=implementation source=explicit policy=spawn.workload_classes pair=muse/muse-spark/max pair_source=explicit match=recommended_rank_1 snapshot=sha256:12703c4ea40d4bba69ef5e32089d666fbbcc482e0bd7b83006fefd0daca183ea rationale=\\\\\\\"Rework rev2 of TASK-260924-3n78rv: vocabulary-derived text-axis sweep + single end-of-work refresh-candidate after stale intent cleared; chain 3 muse max.\\\\\\\"\\\\nspawn agent resolution: Agent selection: muse via explicit_override (preferred_agentic_system: mixed[muse,codex,claude], config: spawn.preferred_agentic_system)\\\\nspawn queued: [implementer] developer (muse) (run=RUN-260924-d25897, max_parallel=20)\\\\nspawn run started: [implementer] developer (muse) (run=RUN-260924-d25897)\\\",\\\"outcomeResources\\\":[{\\\"name\\\":\\\"TASK-260924-3n78rv_spawn-log_-implementer--developer--muse-_RUN-260924-aa8f5f.log\\\",\\\"uri\\\":\\\"file://TASK-260924-3n78rv/TASK-260924-3n78rv_spawn-log_-implementer--developer--muse-_RUN-260924-aa8f5f.log\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"System spawn log captured by task-board\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"TASK-260924-3n78rv_results.md\\\",\\\"uri\\\":\\\"file://TASK-260924-3n78rv/TASK-260924-3n78rv_results.md\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Producer results: 18/18 AC rows, validation table, bounds\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"TASK-260924-3n78rv_conformance-matrix.md\\\",\\\"uri\\\":\\\"file://TASK-260924-3n78rv/TASK-260924-3n78rv_conformance-matrix.md\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Gate x entry census with importer outcome grid\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"TASK-260924-3n78rv_producer-evidence.tar.gz\\\",\\\"uri\\\":\\\"file://TASK-260924-3n78rv/TASK-260924-3n78rv_producer-evidence.tar.gz\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Evidence: suite/vet/harnessx2/guard-controls/owners/importer/diff logs (25KB)\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"TASK-260924-3n78rv_change-request_rev1.patch\\\",\\\"uri\\\":\\\"file://TASK-260924-3n78rv/TASK-260924-3n78rv_change-request_rev1.patch\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Change Request CR-TASK-260924-3n78rv-1 revision 1 candidate patch (repository_delta=present, 16 changed paths)\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"TASK-260924-3n78rv_change-request_rev1-validation.log\\\",\\\"uri\\\":\\\"file://TASK-260924-3n78rv/TASK-260924-3n78rv_change-request_rev1-validation.log\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Change Request CR-TASK-260924-3n78rv-1 revision 1 bounded validation log\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"TASK-260924-3n78rv_spawn-log_-reviewer--reviewer--codex-_RUN-260924-dda856.log\\\",\\\"uri\\\":\\\"file://TASK-260924-3n78rv/TASK-260924-3n78rv_spawn-log_-reviewer--reviewer--codex-_RUN-260924-dda856.log\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"System spawn log captured by task-board\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"TASK-260924-3n78rv_review-verdict-rev1.md\\\",\\\"uri\\\":\\\"file://TASK-260924-3n78rv/TASK-260924-3n78rv_review-verdict-rev1.md\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Reviewer verdict: authority-axis test gap and stale trunk candidate\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"TASK-260924-3n78rv_review-evidence-rev1.tar.gz\\\",\\\"uri\\\":\\\"file://TASK-260924-3n78rv/TASK-260924-3n78rv_review-evidence-rev1.tar.gz\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Review reproductions, raw mutant logs, suites, importer grid and exact-tree checks\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"TASK-260924-3n78rv_spawn-log_-implementer--developer--muse-_RUN-260924-d25897.log\\\",\\\"uri\\\":\\\"file://TASK-260924-3n78rv/TASK-260924-3n78rv_spawn-log_-implementer--developer--muse-_RUN-260924-d25897.log\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"System spawn log captured by task-board\\\"}],\\\"status\\\":\\\"development\\\"}\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 11702,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 2926,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","correlation_facts":{"tool_name":"bash","outcome":"success"}}}
