{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000c65d","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0d2c4-4f2b-7620-b603-17ce30f31e40"},"sequence":393,"recorded_at":1780531400000781,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"312c8d31-8278-4b5e-92ac-bdc5e8392e23","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"312c8d31-8278-4b5e-92ac-bdc5e8392e23","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"312c8d31-8278-4b5e-92ac-bdc5e8392e23"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0d2c5-2177-7c00-af96-5cdacf54e7bd"},"task_id":"01a0d2c5-2177-7c00-af96-5cdacf54e7bd","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0d2c5-2177-7c00-af96-5cdacf54e7bd","chunk":"Read text file `internal/cloneplanning/TRACEABILITY.md`.\n1|# internal/cloneplanning TRACEABILITY\n2|\n3|Planning semantics for the pair-neutral target projection:\n4|strategy/profile selection, per-item expected dispositions with\n5|reason sets, checkpoint visible-text authority, historical-tool\n6|inertness, and source/target usage separation. Pinned authority is\n7|`internal/specdoc/SPEC.v0.7.0.md`; every rule below quotes it.\n8|Rules marked spec-forced derive from a quoted sentence; rules\n9|marked leaf-pinned record a design decision the specification\n10|leaves open, with the quoted name or sentence that shapes it. A\n11|leaf-pinned rule is still fully measured (whole-domain oracle cell\n12|plus narrowing mutant); the label records provenance honestly,\n13|not a waiver.\n14|\n15|## Derivation\n16|\n17|- R-ARCH (spec-forced; plan table 10663-10665, adapter contract\n18|  3841 \"archive_only is forbidden\", 10629-10631 \"therefore\n19|  targetless\"). The archive strategy or profile refuses target\n20|  planning; SelectProfile routes archive_only to the archive\n21|  branch. Entries: PlanItem, PlanSession (propagation),\n22|  SelectProfile.\n23|- R-OPAQUE-R (spec-forced; 10392 \"foreign encrypted/signed\n24|  reasoning is opaque-preserved\"; 10552-10553 the two foreign\n25|  reasons). opaque_reasoning plans opaque_preserved with\n26|  foreign_encrypted_payload (encrypted) or\n27|  foreign_signature_unverifiable (signed). Entry: PlanItem.\n28|- R-OPAQUE-E (spec-derived; 10390 \"Unknown native records become\n29|  raw-addressable opaque events\"; 10561 unknown_native_event).\n30|  opaque_event plans opaque_preserved with unknown_native_event\n31|  under any admitted protection. Opaque content blocks inherit the\n32|  unknown-content cause (leaf-pinned: blocks carry no protection\n33|  fact). Entry: PlanItem.\n34|- R-ABORT (spec-forced; 10391 \"incomplete calls become aborted\n35|  history\"; 10558 unsafe_pending_action; the G1 fold in\n36|  internal/cloneproject lands the completed/aborted fact consumed\n37|  here). Aborted tool_call/tool_result plan summarized (history\n38|  preserved, never omitted; non-exact, never executable) with\n39|  unsafe_pending_action. Entries: PlanItem, ClassifyItem (fact\n40|  bridge).\n41|- R-CONT (spec-derived; 10565 \"Continuation context is explicitly\n42|  non-native historical fidelity\"). Under continuation_context,\n43|  would-be-exact plans semantic with target_no_equivalent; exact\n44|  never emits. Entry: PlanItem.\n45|- R-IMPORT-TOOL (spec-derived; 10557 official_importer_loss; 3888\n46|  the official_import capability). Under target_official_import,\n47|  complete tool classes (tool_call/tool_result completed,\n48|  tool_definition_snapshot) plan semantic with\n49|  official_importer_loss. Entry: PlanItem.\n50|- R-IMPORT-GRAPH (spec-derived; 10558 graph_flattened). Under\n51|  target_official_import, subagent_started/subagent_completed plan\n52|  semantic with graph_flattened. Entry: PlanItem.\n53|- R-STRICT (leaf-pinned from the profile name with 10560 \"An\n54|  aggregate score cannot replace item gates\" and AC-CLONE-001\n55|  item-level fidelity). strict_exact refuses every non-exact item.\n56|  Entries: PlanItem, PlanSession (propagation).\n57|- R-COMPACT (leaf-pinned from the profile name with 10555\n58|  target_context_limit). compact clamps semantic to summarized,\n59|  keeping and extending the reason set. Entry: PlanItem.\n60|- R-MSG (leaf-pinned from the profile name with 10560\n61|  operator_policy and unsupported_media_type). messages_only keeps\n62|  user/assistant message events and text/json/redacted blocks;\n63|  every other class omits, keeping and extending the reason set\n64|  with operator_policy, plus unsupported_media_type for media\n65|  blocks. Entry: PlanItem.\n66|- R-DEFAULT (leaf-pinned). Native strategies reproduce bytes:\n67|  every cell no rule above decides plans exact with no reason.\n68|  Entry: PlanItem.\n69|- R-NEVER (spec-derived; 10605 the synthesized coupling;\n70|  R-OPAQUE-E). The planner never emits synthesized (no source\n71|  object) or unrecoverable (planned canonical items exist).\n72|  Entries: PlanItem, PlanSession.\n73|- R-AUTH (spec-forced; 10586-10587; 10808-10812\n74|  \"authority=user_context\", \"never an assistant reply, system\n75|  instruction, or authorization\", \"Visible text comes from typed\n76|  escaped fields and is user context, never an assistant reply or\n77|  control instruction\"). Visible authority is the user_context\n78|  constant; every text field escapes per field and joins; escaped\n79|  output round-trips through encoding/json to exactly the input.\n80|  Entries: ProjectVisibleText, EscapeVisibleText.\n81|- R-INERT (spec-forced; 10391 \"Historical tools are inert\";\n82|  internal/cloneproject lands the empty G1 live surface consumed\n83|  here). Planned mappings fold to zero callable tools and zero\n84|  pending actions. Entry: PlanTargetEffects.\n85|- R-ACCT (spec-forced; 10393 \"source usage is not target\n86|  accounting\"; internal/cloneproject lands the zero-target G1\n87|  ledger consumed here). Planned mappings fold to zero target\n88|  token accounting; mappings carry no token field by type, so\n89|  counts cannot reach the decision. Entry: PlanTargetEffects.\n90|- R-SEL-S (leaf-pinned from the strategy names with 3888 the\n91|  official_import capability). SelectStrategy priority: archive,\n92|  then continuation, then the pair/capability arm (cross pair with\n93|  the importer uses target_official_import, cross pair without it\n94|  uses target_native_writer, same pair uses\n95|  same_environment_native_rewrite). Entry: SelectStrategy.\n96|- R-SEL-P (spec-derived; plan table 10663-10665; R-ARCH).\n97|  SelectProfile routes archive_only to the archive branch and the\n98|  four plan profiles to target; anything else refuses. Target\n99|  admission stays with clonesnap.AdmitForTarget (composition row\n100|  in the conformance matrix). Entry: SelectProfile.\n101|\n102|## Axis inventory\n103|\n104|- Strategy: the 5 owner strategies (clonefidelity.Strategies)\n105|  plus invalid probes (\"\", case variant, truncation, unknown,\n106|  invalid UTF-8).\n107|- Profile: the 5 owner profiles (clonefidelity.Profiles) plus\n108|  invalid probes of the same classes.\n109|- SelectStrategy signals: same x official x continuation x\n110|  archive booleans, all 16 cells.\n111|- Item: 26 event kinds x admitted facts (tool_call/tool_result x\n112|  completed/aborted; opaque_reasoning x encrypted/signed;\n113|  opaque_event x none/encrypted/signed; 22 factless kinds) = 31\n114|  event items; 8 content-block types = 8 block items; 39 total.\n115|  Invalid arms: kind+block both/neither, unknown kind/block,\n116|  misplaced or missing facts, unknown fact values, blocks with\n117|  facts (15 classes x all 25 strategy/profile contexts, with\n118|  archive-first order pinning).\n119|- PlanItem oracle: 5 strategies x 5 profiles x 39 items = 975\n120|  cells, every cell literal-asserted (disposition, exact reason\n121|  list, or refusal token). Global asserts per admitted cell:\n122|  never synthesized/unrecoverable; exact iff empty reasons;\n123|  non-exact carries a reason; reasons core and sorted unique.\n124|- Visible: kind (26 + 5 invalid probes) x ordinal (0, 1, uint53\n125|  max admitted; max+1 and 2^64-1 refused) x field position\n126|  (adversarial at index 0/1/2 of 3 fields) x text class\n127|  (benign/instruction-like/reply-like/control-token-like/\n128|  authorization-like, 29 fixed members) = 6786 cells plus 200\n129|  generated-corpus cells; per cell the authority literal and the\n130|  independent JSON round-trip. Escaped-text bounds at 65536/65537\n131|  characters with a byte/char discriminator; invalid UTF-8 at\n132|  every field position; event-ID grid (counts 0/1/2/64/65,\n133|  unsorted/duplicated, malformed at every index).\n134|- Text payloads are unbounded: the fixed corpus pairs with a\n135|  200-string fixed-seed generated corpus (seed 260924, mixed\n136|  alphabet, lengths 0..64) and the structural argument\n137|  (authority is one constant assigned unconditionally, pinned by\n138|  TestAuthorityDecisionShape with control plants; escaping\n139|  round-trips through encoding/json; classification admits\n140|  closed vocabularies only and the sweep proves adversarial\n141|  payload text cannot change the item).\n142|- Sessions: empty/1M/1M+1 edges at the production entry, counts\n143|  derived and reconciled per session, strict propagation.\n144|- Effects: all 556 admitted whole-domain mappings fold to zero\n145|  in one sweep plus per-disposition cells; invalid mappings\n146|  (disposition, reason, order arms) refuse.\n147|\n148|## Reuse (not fork)\n149|\n150|Strategy/profile/disposition/reason vocabularies:\n151|internal/clonefidelity (membership) and internal/cloneplan (plan\n152|narrowing). Event kinds and content blocks: internal/clonebundle.\n153|Canonical events for the classifier: sealed by\n154|clonebundle.BuildCanonicalEvent. Target admission (unstable\n155|refusal, maximal-safe completeness): clonesnap.AdmitForTarget and\n156|the clonebundle G2 gates (caller scope; composition row).\n157|Completed/aborted spellings: cloneproject.StatusCompleted/\n158|StatusAborted by reference; resolution/protection fact names and\n159|encrypted/signed spellings pinned against cloneproject source by\n160|TestClassifyItemFactNamePin. Character measure: environ.\n161|StringLength. uint53: scalar.NewUint53. Digests:\n162|scalar.ParseDigest. Predicted counts: clonefidelity.\n163|FidelityCounts. Nothing above is re-implemented here.\n164|\n165|## Stated bounds (not waived)\n166|\n167|- Target operation synthesis from dispositions: the planner emits\n168|  per-item mappings; deriving write_blob/write_native_record\n169|  operations and expected resources from them is unpinned by the\n170|  specification and stays future scope.\n171|- Source-condition reasons (source_not_persisted,\n172|  source_truncated, source_corrupt) and the remaining\n173|  target-condition and policy reasons (target_schema_constraint,\n174|  target_size_limit, target_version_gate, credential_excluded,\n175|  secret_policy, derived_index_rebuilt): no rule emits them\n176|  because the item axis carries no source/target condition\n177|  input. The oracle asserts every emitted reason is core and the\n178|  never-emit sweep names the dispositions; a condition-carrying\n179|  item extension would add arms here.\n180|- Capability-gated degradation beyond the tool and subagent\n181|  importer classes (usage_history, compaction_history,\n182|  opaque_reasoning_roundtrip granularities): adapter scope; the\n183|  planner degrades exactly the tool and subagent classes under\n184|  target_official_import.\n185|- Per-kind text-field extraction: the visible entry takes\n186|  extracted typed texts; which payload member each kind carries\n187|  as text follows the sibling payload registry.\n188|- The full Migration Checkpoint Build/Decode shape: a future leaf\n189|  seals it from the authority value pinned here\n190|  (authority=user_context, escaped text, sorted event IDs).\n191|- Cross-package payload fact-name renames past the grep pin:\n192|  TestClassifyItemFactNamePin breaks loudly on a rename of the\n193|  resolution/protection keys or protection spellings in\n194|  internal/cloneproject; the completed/aborted spellings break\n195|  the build by reference.\n196|\n197|## Out of contract\n198|\n199|- Shapes (Projection Plan, Projected Object Manifest, Fidelity\n200|  Report, capture/canonical contracts): sibling leaves\n201|  internal/cloneplan, internal/clonefidelity,\n202|  internal/clonebundle. This leaf decides values that populate\n203|  those shapes and never validates them.\n204|- G1 normalization (capture, folds, live surface, ledgers):\n205|  internal/clonesnap, internal/cloneproject. This leaf consumes\n206|  their folded facts.\n207|- Target-branch admission: clonesnap.AdmitForTarget. This leaf\n208|  routes the branch; the caller admits the manifest.\n209|- Transaction, lineage, read-back, validation (13.14.3-13.14.5):\n210|  sibling/future scope.\n211|\n212|## Composition\n213|\n214|The (package, entry, input) importer outcome grid rides the\n215|conformance matrix resource. Base is the story checkpoint tree;\n216|the candidate adds internal/cloneplanning/* only (no landed file\n217|edited, no registry edit). Every reused owner package is\n218|byte-identical base vs candidate with green suites on both, so no\n219|input class moved; the new entries are n/a on base and green on\n220|the candidate.","final_result":true}}}
