 typed inline content or Blob Descriptor references; inline\n10389|content is at most 64 KiB. Unknown native records become raw-addressable opaque\n10390|events. Historical tools\n10391|are inert; incomplete calls become aborted history and block pending action.\n10392|Foreign instructions are low-authority history, foreign encrypted/signed\n10393|reasoning is opaque-preserved, and source usage is not target accounting.\n10394|\n10395|The following closed shapes govern this subsection; the preceding prose is a\n10396|summary and does not permit omitted or additional members.\n10397|\n10398|<code>NativeIdentity</code> contains exactly\n10399|<code>native_session_id:string[1..512]</code>,\n10400|<code>identity_kind:provider_native|official_import|continuation_context</code>,\n10401|<code>logical_workspace_id:UUIDv7</code>,\n10402|<code>backend_realm_fingerprint:digest|null</code>,\n10403|<code>opaque_identity:string[1..512]|null</code>, and\n10404|<code>extensions</code>. It contains no credential, absolute source path as\n(more lines below)","final_result":true}}}
