ry census with the (package, entry, input) importer\n22|grid: `TASK-260924-3n78rv_conformance-matrix.md`.\n23|\n24|## AC coverage, measured: 18 of 18 rows driven\n25|\n26|Each row names its production call site; every refusal is\n27|literal-pinned and every gate carries a killed narrowing (matrix\n28|names them). Denominator: description + AC + DoD rows 1-2.\n29|\n30|| # | Row | Call site | Test |\n31||---|---|---|---|\n32|| 1 | Strategy selection, 16 cells | SS | TestSelectStrategyOracle |\n33|| 2 | Profile branch routing, 5 + invalids | SP | TestSelectProfileOracle |\n34|| 3 | Item dispositions + reasons, 975 cells | PI | TestPlanItemWholeDomainOracle + 8 rule tests |\n35|| 4 | Archive refusal with branch message | PI, SP | TestPlanItemArchiveRule, TestSelectProfileOracle |\n36|| 5 | Continuation never exact | PI | TestPlanItemContinuationRule |\n37|| 6 | Opaque reasons by protection/cause | PI | TestPlanItemOpaqueRule |\n38|| 7 | Aborted tools are summarized history | PI, CI | TestPlanItemAbortRule, TestClassifyItemValidGrid |\n39|| 8 | Importer tool loss + graph flattening | PI | TestPlanItemImporterRule |\n40|| 9 | Strict/compact/messages overlays | PI | TestPlanItemStrictRule, TestPlanItemCompactRule, TestPlanItemMessagesRule |\n41|| 10 | Visible authority always user_context | PV | TestProjectVisibleWholeDomain (6986 cells) |\n42|| 11 | Escaping round-trips via encoding/json | PV, EV | TestProjectVisibleWholeDomain, TestProjectVisibleEscapingOracle |\n43|| 12 | Adversarial text never gains authority (4 classes x kinds x ordinals x field positions x entries) | PV, CI | TestProjectVisibleWholeDomain, TestProjectVisiblePositionIndependence, TestClassifyItemIgnoresPayloadText; SS/SP/PI/PS/TE take no text by type |\n44|| 13 | Tools inert; pending blocked | TE, PI | TestPlanTargetEffectsZeroSweep, TestPlanTargetEffectsChained |\n45|| 14 | Source usage never target accounting | TE | TestPlanTargetEffectsZeroSweep (556 mappings + per-disposition) |\n46|| 15 | Token classes (control-token text + usage counts) | PV, TE | rows 11 + 14 probes |\n47|| 16 | Vendor importer strategy arm | PI | TestPlanItemImporterRule |\n48|| 17 | Session counts + empty/1M/1M+1 edges | PS | TestPlanSessionCounts, TestPlanSessionRefusals, TestPlanSessionMillionEdge |\n49|| 18 | Importer grid base vs candidate, moved classes named | — | owners-base/candidate.log, byte-identity.txt (232 files, 0 differ, moved none) |\n50|\n51|Stated bounds (not waived): operation synthesis; source/target\n52|condition reasons outside the item axis; capability-gated\n53|degradation past tool/subagent importer classes; per-kind\n54|text-field extraction; full Migration Checkpoint sealing;\n55|fact-name renames past the grep pin. See TRACEABILITY.md.\n56|\n57|## Out-of-contract rows (declared, not silent)\n58|\n59|- Closed shapes (plan, manifest, fidelity report, capture,\n60|  canonical): sibling leaves cloneplan/clonefidelity/clonebundle;\n61|  this leaf decides populating values, never validates shapes.\n62|- G1 normalization and folds: clonesnap/cloneproject; consumed\n63|  here by reference and source pin.\n64|- Target-branch admission: clonesnap.AdmitForTarget (caller\n65|  scope); this leaf routes the branch only.\n66|- Transaction, lineage, read-back, validation (13.14.3-13.14.5):\n67|  sibling/future scope.\n68|\n69|## Brief gap (handoff precondition 1)\n70|\n71|The brief carries no surface table, so there is no surface row to\n72|map. Coverage map substitute: the clause map in\n73|`internal/cloneplanning/TRACEABILITY.md` maps every derivation\n74|rule to its production entries and named tests, and the\n75|conformance matrix maps every gate to its entries, killer tests,\n76|and killed narrowings (48 narrowings + 1 control).\n77|\n78|## Reviewer tests kept\n79|\n80|None exist yet (initial revision): no previously committed\n81|reviewer test to keep.\n82|\n83|## Validation (real exit codes)\n84|\n85|| Command | Exit | Evidence |\n86||---|---|---|\n87|| `go test -coun